flowchart LR
    A[main.go] --> B[config.Load]
    B --> C[database.Connect]
    C --> D{tableExists?}
    D -->|yes| E[RunMigrations<br/>idempotent ALTER + UPDATE blocks<br/>per table]
    D -->|first boot| F[skip blocks]
    E --> G[GORM AutoMigrate<br/>creates new tables]
    F --> G
    G --> H[RunPostMigrations<br/>FK sweep on folders]
    H --> I[auth.Init / email.Init / judge0.Init]
    I --> J[reminder.Start ticker]
    J --> K[gin.Run :8080]
